Package: synthdid
Title: Synthetic Difference-in-Difference Estimation
Version: 2.0.0
Author: Dmitry Arkhangelsky [aut]
        Susan Athey [aut]
        David A. Hirshberg [aut, cre]
        Guido W. Imbens [aut]
        Stefan Wager [aut]
Maintainer: David A. Hirshberg <david.a.hirshberg@gmail.com>
Description: Estimate average treatment effects in panel data using
    synthetic difference-in-differences (Arkhangelsky et al. 2021).
    Supports both simultaneous and staggered treatment adoption, with
    the staggered estimator following the cohort decomposition approach
    of Porreca (2022).
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
